{
  "id": "RAW_805e1726a6",
  "title": "我自己做了个 AI 知识库，然后翻车了。",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5Mjc3MjIyMA==&mid=2247586961&idx=1&sn=ddff23c2fac380128966c921eaa1e230",
  "date": "2026-09-19 19:23:00",
  "author": "阿颖",
  "siteName": "AI产品阿颖",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>阿颖</span> <span>2026-09-19 19:23</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_ed2cdc1.jpeg\"></p>\n  <div style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我之前还是低估了企业知识库的难度。不知道大家有没有折腾过类似的系统。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">上周，我们团队在准备 AI Maker Summit 上海站。特别忙。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">我停下来复盘了下，发现大家还是在各种各样的文档之间来回倒腾信息，比如我们有现场的 rundown、预算表、决算表、讲师的分享大纲、PPT、SOP、Checklist，还有之前的用户调查、复盘文档等等。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">我当时就在想，要不干脆做一个知识库吧。</span></span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">恰好这两年，我们组织的大会加起来已经有 100 多场分享。后面可以把这些视频全部转成文本，放进知识库，对外开放给参会用户。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">同时，预算、SOP、复盘文档这些内部资料也可以放进去，只要把权限设置好，就能给我们团队用。一举两得。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">一开始，我真觉得这事挺简单。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">因为涉及的数据量其实不算大，而且这就是一个非常典型的 RAG 场景。当时我觉得，RAG 这套东西这几年已经很成熟了，基本思路也不复杂。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">大致就是文档切块，然后做 Embedding，最后放进 Vector Database。用户提问的时候先做语义匹配，找到相关内容，再把检索结果交给大模型回答。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">说干就干，我花了 3 亿多 Token，立马做了一个雏形。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.43984375\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"display:block;width:560px;max-width:100%;height:246px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iagroyM7YaBlSibPM3RfXBw7Zs5R940KlGgNVOSQpicPd2L3IRicRVeWibubG6cd74kWroz5nDdGvaRBXbJ9QuTaoKX5ImVHYkxLTunl6F3T5Rmc/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropx1=\"0\" data-cropx2=\"2530.960854092527\" data-cropy1=\"0\" data-cropy2=\"1111.8149466192172\" data-imgfileid=\"100103283\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_17c5107.jpeg\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">兴奋的测试了下，发现在一些重要的场景里，表现很差劲。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">比如我问它，这次大会的利润率是多少。结果它给我找出来的，居然是去年北京站的利润率。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我排查了一下才发现，它其实只是根据这个问题去找语义上最相关的内容，最后命中了几份提到利润率的旧资料。但我问的是今年这一次大会的利润率啊。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">虽然这次大会还没有计算过利润率，但我们有决算表，里面写了成本和收入，完全可以计算出来。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">它并没有这么做。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我继续改，改了半天。没 Token 了。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2490740740740741\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103256\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_59d37a0.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\">冷静下来复盘了下，我意识到，RAG 的准确率，首先取决于 Retrieval 的质量。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">如果前面 Retrieval 环节找错了资料，那后面模型推理几乎没有意义。</span></span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">周日在机场，我打电话和大学同学讨论了下这些技术路线。发现这事情确实还是比较麻烦。直白点说，我虽然上传了一堆文档、Excel 等等，但他们之间并不完全是孤立的关系。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">比如一份预算表对应的是哪一届大会，里面的支出又对应哪些供应商。一个讲师的分享大纲，后面还会关联到他的 PPT、现场视频和最终复盘.......</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">于是，我开始发朋友圈求助。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.22816901408450704\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2130\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103286\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_4d8b6a3.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">很快，有朋友回复了我。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">避免有同学说这是软广，我提前声明一下，这完完全全是一次真实的使用经验分享，我也没有做过什么横向测评。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">只是这个产品确实解决了我当时遇到的问题，所以我想把自己怎么踩坑、最后又怎么解决的，完整分享给大家。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.22873345935727787\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1058\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103280\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_f1f559d.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我再梳理下我的需求：</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">1）做一个成熟可用的知识库。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">2）知识库最好自带 Agent 能力，可以生成文档、PPT 等。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">3）知识库可以被 Codex 之类的第三方 Agent 调用。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">4）需要可以进行权限控制。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">5）有成熟的文档治理的能力。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">这些需求，腾讯乐享 100% 都可以搞定。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">截个图，大家看看。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.42981072555205047\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2536\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103294\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_b43a30f.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">新建团队之类的基础功能，我就不赘述了。很简单。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5611111111111111\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103261\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_3086007.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我麻溜的把电脑里所有的文件都传了上来。每个文件夹一个知识库，分门别类。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4156450671336836\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"3426\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103298\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_2a521cb.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">每个知识库也都可以设置权限。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.29074074074074074\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103263\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_9c29a45.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">继续，我还是问问刚才的问题，这次大会的利润率。大家看看我在腾讯乐享中得到的回复：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.35340572556762095\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2026\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103289\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_91d76bd.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我上传的所有文档中，有三个文档提到了支出的情况。其中有两个文档是不同的版本，另外一个文档是具体的支出明细。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">大家看，会发现他会逐一的去核对，然后最后推理出来最后那张那个表才是准确的数据。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3469387755102041\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2058\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103282\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_96dcbe9.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">下面这是最终的结论，太牛了这个。可以的可以的。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.20076117982873454\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2102\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103288\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_8322aaa.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">接下来我必须讲一下，为什么它的回答会比我自己做的知识库准这么多。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\">一个很重要的原因，是它在检索之前，先做了一层知识加工。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">也就是知识图谱。</span></span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯乐享会把知识库里的内容按关系连接起来。随便点开一个节点，就能看到它关联了哪些文档，和其他信息是什么关系。每个知识库，都可以形成自己对应的知识图谱。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">比如这里点开 AI Engineer，右边可以直接看到相关文档，以及它和大会设置、演讲嘉宾这些信息之间的关系。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">这些内容都来自知识库本身。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3565098841172461\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2934\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103295\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_08d1a93.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">前面讲过，我自己搭的那套 RAG，核心还是语义检索。先把文档切块，用户提问以后，再从里面找出语义最相关的内容交给模型。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">这个办法在资料比较简单的时候很好用。但企业里的知识，往往没这么规整。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">比如一笔支出，年初预算里有一个数字，执行过程中调整过一次，最后决算又有一个数字。这三份文件都在讲同一件事，里面甚至会出现三个不同的答案。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果只看语义相似度，它们都非常相关。</span><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\">系统很容易把几份资料一起找出来，却不知道它们之间到底是什么关系，更不知道哪一份更新，或者哪一份已经失效。</span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">知识图谱可以很好的解决这些问题。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">它会把散落在不同文档里的同一件事关联起来。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\">系统先知道这些资料讲的是同一个项目、同一笔预算或者同一个人，后面才有机会继续判断它们之间有没有版本变化，有没有信息冲突。</span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我还发现，腾讯乐享的知识图谱里专门做了一个冲突检测。这个功能很实用。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">毕竟企业里的资料经常来自不同部门、不同阶段。同一件事情，可能在不同文档里出现不同版本。冲突检测会自动检测这些冲突。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">这相当于在 Retrieval 之前，先把知识本身检查一遍。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5378868729989328\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1874\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103296\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_fb2b72e.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">这个设计还挺好的。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">另外，腾讯乐享还有一个 LLM Wiki 的功能。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3944141689373297\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2936\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103284\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_58cba9a.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我一开始看到 Wiki 这个词，还以为它是在做一个新的知识页面。后来才发现不是。<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">它其实是把前面上传的所有信息，整理成更适合 Agent 理解和调用的知识。</span></span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">因为企业过去大量资料，本来就是写给人看的。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">PDF、Word、PPT 什么格式都有，人看问题不大，但 Agent 真正调用起来，经常会遇到结构乱、版本冲突、上下文缺失这些问题。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\">LLM Wiki 直接把这些原始资料变成更适合 Agent 读取和调用的知识。</span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.41216216216216217\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"3256\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103297\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_ccd980e.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家记得Karpathy 今年有条爆火的 LLM 知识库的帖子，其实就是类似的功能。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1188\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103281\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_4341fd4.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">对了，WorkBuddy、豆包工作等等 Agent 也和乐享知识库打通了。大家可以去连接器里找。下面这是豆包工作的截图。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.28426395939086296\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2364\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103287\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_053904f.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">我用熟悉的 WorkBuddy 调用乐享的知识库，给大会做了个复盘的 Slides。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">就不给大家录屏了，隐私数据比较多。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4728744939271255\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2470\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103291\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_3ffbbb2.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">我们的参会者可以接入进来，随便提问大会涉及到的内容：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.48661233993015135\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1718\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103292\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_344d90a.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">我们还能随手在 WorkBuddy 中更新知识库的内容。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3924914675767918\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1758\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103285\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_7f60fb9.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">稍等一会就更新好了，WorkBuddy 还顺便整了一个分析出来。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.351981351981352\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1716\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103290\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_e1a4d4b.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">文件已经可以在后台看到了。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 16px;padding:0;text-align:center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"文章图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5381526104417671\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1992\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:2px;\" data-imgfileid=\"100103293\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260919212757_386c49e.png\"></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">到这里，从写文章到把整个知识库搭起来，前后花了 4 个多小时，这事总算搞定了。</span></span></strong></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">哎，我突然意识到，自己还是把企业知识库理解窄了。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">最开始我的想法很简单，就是给同事和用户提供一个更好的信息查询入口。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin:0px 8px 16px;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9);text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span leaf=\"\">但真正花时间搭建起来以后，我发现，知识库的用途远远不只是搜索资料。当它可以被 Agent 调用，它就能够成为 Agent 工作时依赖的 Context。</span></p>\n   <p data-body-paragraph=\"true\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px;padding: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);text-align: justify;word-break: break-word;\"><strong data-auto-emphasis=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;color: inherit;\"><span leaf=\"\">是的，为 Agent 准备可信的 Context，这应该会成为接下来企业落地 AI 最重要的事情之一。</span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "作者自建 AI 知识库失败后，发现腾讯乐享通过知识图谱和 LLM Wiki 等功能，解决了企业知识的结构化、版本冲突和 Agent 调用等问题，最终用 4 小时搭建了可用的知识库并接入 WorkBuddy。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "作者自建 AI 知识库失败后，发现腾讯乐享通过知识图谱和 LLM Wiki 等功能，解决了企业知识的结构化、版本冲突和 Agent 调用等问题，最终用 4 小时搭建了可用的知识库并接入 WorkBuddy。",
  "summary": "作者分享了自己搭建 AI 知识库的失败经历与腾讯乐享的解决方案。他最初低估了企业知识库的难度，用传统 RAG 方案花 3 亿 Token 做了雏形，但发现语义检索无法解决企业知识中常见的版本冲突、信息关联等问题——例如多份文档讲同一笔预算但给出不同数字，系统无法判断哪份最新。在朋友提醒下，他尝试腾讯乐享，发现其核心优势在于：知识图谱将散落文档按实体关联起来，支持冲突检测；LLM Wiki 将人类可读的原始资料转换为 Agent 友好格式；已与 WorkBuddy、豆包工作等 Agent 打通。最终用 4 小时搭建完成，实现了权限控制、Agent 调用和在线更新。作者总结：为 Agent 准备可信 Context 将成为企业 AI 落地的关键。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "传统 RAG 在企业知识库场景下失效",
      "explanation": "作者自建方案仅做语义检索，无法解决企业知识的核心问题：多份文档讲同一件事（如预算、讲师）但版本不同、存在冲突，系统无法判断哪份最新、哪份失效，导致回答准确率低。"
    },
    {
      "point": "知识图谱是解决企业知识关联与冲突的关键",
      "explanation": "腾讯乐享将知识库内容按实体（项目、预算、人）关联成图谱，支持冲突检测，在检索前先解决知识间的版本与冲突问题，显著提升回答准确性。"
    },
    {
      "point": "LLM Wiki 将人类可读资料转为 Agent 可调用格式",
      "explanation": "企业资料多为 PDF、Word、PPT 等人类可读格式，Agent 调用时结构乱、上下文缺失。LLM Wiki 功能将原始资料结构化为 Agent 友好格式，解决了异构文档的 Agent 兼容性问题。"
    },
    {
      "point": "知识库应定位为 Agent 的可信 Context 来源",
      "explanation": "作者从搜索工具的思维跳出，认识到知识库的核心价值是为 Agent 提供可信、可追溯的上下文，已与 WorkBuddy 等 Agent 打通，实现知识更新与 Agent 协同。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "我花了 3 亿多 Token，立马做了一个雏形。兴奋的测试了下，发现在一些重要的场景里，表现很差劲。比如我问它，这次大会的利润率是多少。结果它给我找出来的，居然是去年北京站的利润率。",
    "如果只看语义相似度，它们都非常相关。系统很容易把几份资料一起找出来，却不知道它们之间到底是什么关系，更不知道哪一份更新，或者哪一份已经失效。",
    "知识图谱可以很好的解决这些问题。它会把散落在不同文档里的同一件事关联起来。系统先知道这些资料讲的是同一个项目、同一笔预算或者同一个人，后面才有机会继续判断它们之间有没有版本变化，有没有信息冲突。",
    "为 Agent 准备可信的 Context，这应该会成为接下来企业落地 AI 最重要的事情之一。",
    "知识库最好自带 Agent 能力，可以生成文档、PPT 等。知识库可以被 Codex 之类的第三方 Agent 调用。"
  ],
